{"id":"fde79d92b8305394","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-differentiable.md","title":"Differentiable","display":"df-differentiable — Differentiable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differentiable","aliases":["58-df-differentiable","Differentiable"],"display":"df-differentiable — Differentiable","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differentiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differentiable</span><span>Differentiable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differentiable — Differentiable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\">\\(f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in U\">\\(x_0\\in U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{n,m}\\in\\mathcal P((\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n})\">\\(\\mathcal L_{n,m}\\in\\mathcal P((\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivative}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivative}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with argument order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,f,U,x_0,n,m)\">\\((L,f,U,x_0,n,m)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with argument order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f,U,x_0,n,m)\">\\((f,U,x_0,n,m)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with argument order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(J,L,n,m)\">\\((J,L,n,m)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^r\">\\(\\mathbb R^r\\)</span> 采用定义域为有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的函数向量编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(au+bv)(i)=au(i)+bv(i)\">\\((au+bv)(i)=au(i)+bv(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|u\\|=(\\sum_{i&lt;r}u(i)^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|u\\|=(\\sum_{i&lt;r}u(i)^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;n\">\\(j&lt;n\\)</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{ij}\">\\(\\delta_{ij}\\)</span> 为相等取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、不等取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的 Kronecker 函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}linear\\text{-}maps} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n}:\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(L(au+bv)=aL(u)+bL(v))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}linear\\text{-}maps} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n}:\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(L(au+bv)=aL(u)+bL(v))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\n\\land x_0\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|h\\|&lt;r\\to x_0+h\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\bigl(0&lt;\\|h\\|&lt;\\delta\\land x_0+h\\in U\\to\n\\|f(x_0+h)-f(x_0)-L(h)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon\\|h\\|\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\n\\land x_0\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|h\\|&lt;r\\to x_0+h\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\bigl(0&lt;\\|h\\|&lt;\\delta\\land x_0+h\\in U\\to\n\\|f(x_0+h)-f(x_0)-L(h)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon\\|h\\|\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}jacobian}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S(J,L,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land J\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;J(i)(j)=L(e_j)(i).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}jacobian}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S(J,L,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land J\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;J(i)(j)=L(e_j)(i).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dimensions are explicit predicate arguments, and differentiation is a relation rather than an unsupported total operator on nondifferentiable points.</li>\n<li>The interior-point clause guarantees uniqueness of the displayed Fréchet derivative; relative differentiability on a thin subset would not determine a unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Gateaux differentiable: directional derivatives exist in all directions</li>\n<li>Chain rule: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(g \\circ f)(x) = Dg(f(x)) \\circ Df(x)\">\\(D(g \\circ f)(x) = Dg(f(x)) \\circ Df(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Inverse-function consequences belong in theorem files.</li>\n<li>Manifold: set locally diffeomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>; smooth structure via differentiable atlases</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spivak, Calculus on Manifolds</li>\n<li>Tu, An Introduction to Manifolds</li>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{n,m}\\in\\mathcal P((\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Derivative}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(L,f,U,x_0,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(f,U,x_0,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(J,L,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"(au+bv)(i)=au(i)+bv(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|u\\|=(\\sum_{i<r}u(i)^2)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\delta_{ij}\\rangle:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"j<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}linear\\text{-}maps} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^{\\mathbb R^n}:\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(L(au+bv)=aL(u)+bL(v))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\n\\land x_0\\in U\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|h\\|<r\\to x_0+h\\in U)\\\\\n&\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\bigl(0<\\|h\\|<\\delta\\land x_0+h\\in U\\to\n\\|f(x_0+h)-f(x_0)-L(h)\\|<\\varepsilon\\|h\\|\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,U,x_0,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Derivative}_S(L,f,U,x_0,n,m).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiable\\text{-}jacobian}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JacobianMatrix}_S(J,L,n,m)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land L\\in\\mathcal L_{n,m}\n\\land J\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^m\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;J(i)(j)=L(e_j)(i).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"D(g \\circ f)(x) = Dg(f(x)) \\circ Df(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":2927,"backlinks":[{"id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-423","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-differentiable.md|58-df-differentiable]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":[]}